  "extractionNotes": "Granted period typed as a ZUS note on the titles screen: 2026-10-01..2026-10-21. Birth date not in the file; inferred as the day after the last benefit day (the benefit runs until the day before birth); the doctor gave 2026-10-21 as the due date. Termination under the 2003 collective-dismissal act because the employer was liquidated; ZAS-55 with the declaration that no other employment was provided; doctor certificate explicitly states the pregnancy existed before the employment ended. Title start: 2020-03-01 on the Z-3 and work certificate, a later date on the ZUS register (anonymisation inconsistency); Z-3 used. Employer reported more than 20 insured. Salary table (2025-2026, 23 500-25 200 monthly plus small benefits in kind and a Christmas bonus) only partly legible and its reference window is unclear (sickness from 2026-04 with carry-over); months omitted, base not printed. Sick-pay and sickness-benefit periods partly illegible; omitted. asOf = query date of the ZUS titles screen carrying the grant note (last document ZUS relied on); the ZAS-55 was filed on 2026-10-13 (plan.applicationDate). The post-birth maternity claim is not in this file."
